removes: a body request's unit of work writes back the credential it began from rather than the one its token holds, so a rotation is never written back
packages: ./api/app
tests: TestEachBodyRequestWritesBackAndRecordsTheAttempt TestARotationWhoseWriteBackFailedIsKept
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

